// # openOODA CLI Fix Cluster — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Front door for the text-patch and file-diagnostic command surface.
//
// Setup: Hosts fix + apply + diag + imp + must + text. fix.oo is the user-facing entry.
//
// Beats:
//   1. fix.oo — entry point for `cli fix <file> --yes`. Drives the check-apply loop.
//   2. Patch surface: apply, must, imp, text — apply text-level edits.
//   3. Diagnostic classifier: diag.oo — map oodac check output to ecap, etc, eparse, eimp, emust.

import "fix.oo";
import "apply.oo";
import "must.oo";
import "imp.oo";
import "text.oo";
import "diag.oo";
